{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001", "id": 1620383693, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5glRfN", "number": 2001, "title": "MavFrame enum is not correct?", "user": {"login": "chengguizi", "id": 7508112, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc1MDgxMTI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7508112?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi", "html_url": "https://github.com/chengguizi", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2023-03-12T14:21:57Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-31T22:19:45Z", "closed_at": "2026-03-31T22:19:45Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "In the file https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/src/mavsdk/plugins/mocap/include/plugins/mocap/mocap.h\r\n\r\nI see MavFrame is defined like the following, which is used to fill up the ODOMETRY message for MAVLINK. I assume they are arrange so `MocapNed` is coded as 0 and `LocalFrd` is coded as 1\r\n\r\n```\r\n        enum class MavFrame {\r\n            MocapNed, /**< @brief MAVLink number: 14. Odometry local coordinate frame of data given\r\n                         by a motion capture system, Z-down (x: north, y: east, z: down).. */\r\n            LocalFrd, /**< @brief MAVLink number: 20. Forward, Right, Down coordinate frame. This is\r\n                         a local frame with Z-down and arbitrary F/R alignment (i.e. not aligned\r\n                         with NED/earth frame). Replacement for MAV_FRAME_MOCAP_NED,\r\n                         MAV_FRAME_VISION_NED, MAV_FRAME_ESTIM_NED.. */\r\n        };\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, in MAVLINK they are coded both at 20. Is this something wrong here? Shouldn't we just expose the API as the native MAVLink enum, instead of MAVSDK custom ones?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/src/mavsdk/plugins/mocap/include/plugins/mocap/mocap.h#L293\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1465282173", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001#issuecomment-1465282173", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001", "id": 1465282173, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5XVm59", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-03-12T19:39:38Z", "updated_at": "2023-03-12T19:39:38Z", "body": "The MAVLink frames are messy and there are two many of it, so my goal was to only expose a smaller but working subset in MAVSDK.\r\n\r\nHowever, I think you are right that the implementation is not correct. It seems like it's just hard-coded?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/e7231dc8f390b96f4682e6810ac3d2fe554b5b8b/src/mavsdk/plugins/mocap/mocap_impl.cpp#L223\r\n\r\nWould you mind making a pull request to fix it?\r\n", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1465282173/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1465349632", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001#issuecomment-1465349632", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001", "id": 1465349632, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5XV3YA", "user": {"login": "chengguizi", "id": 7508112, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc1MDgxMTI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7508112?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi", "html_url": "https://github.com/chengguizi", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chengguizi/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-03-13T00:40:30Z", "updated_at": "2023-03-13T00:40:30Z", "body": "Sure @julianoes \r\n\r\nActually the line you just quoted has no issues, ok to be hardcoded. The issue is the line above.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/e7231dc8f390b96f4682e6810ac3d2fe554b5b8b/src/mavsdk/plugins/mocap/mocap_impl.cpp#L222\r\n\r\nI will do pull requests once I verify things on a real PX4 system :)", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1465349632/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}], "timeline": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1465282173", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001#issuecomment-1465282173", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2001", "id": 1465282173, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5XVm59", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organiza